  "off": 3728,
  "end": 3740,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"Like I'd know!\"",
  "src": "e3c90fab1a1d"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0059",
  "off": 3746,
  "end": 3848,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:5e",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"Me, I think it's because of the heart.{n} I think the human heart, grown so{n} complex, gives birth to such feelings.\"",
  "src": "af948c2abbb5"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0060",
  "off": 3854,
  "end": 3926,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"Then humans will kill each other off{n} and vanish from this earth someday.\"",
  "src": "7ed04a6882f8"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0061",
  "off": 3932,
  "end": 3954,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:5e",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"Maybe so.\"",
  "src": "fe3ed56170a3"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0062",
  "off": 3956,
  "end": 4054,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:5e",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"But I don't think so. It's true humans{n} have a savagery no other animal{n} has. But you know...\"",
  "src": "c7977e4d6758"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0063",
  "off": 4056,
  "end": 4142,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:5e",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"At the same time, they also have a heart{n} that creates all sorts of things, and{n} respects and cherishes others.\"",
  "src": "d8a2cd1977c8"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0064",
  "off": 4148,
  "end": 4234,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"You're soft. Way too soft.{n} Take a look at this country now.{n} Where do you see people like that?\"",
  "src": "ae06def7b9e3"
 },
 {
