  "end": 4462,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:5e",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"You too: if you dislike who you are{n} now, you can change as much as you{n} like. If only you wish for it strongly.\"",
  "src": "760014fa7f1a"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0068",
  "off": 4468,
  "end": 4546,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"I like who I am now.{n} Sorry to tell you, but I also{n} love killing people.\"",
  "src": "7d2043315bf2"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0069",
  "off": 4552,
  "end": 4608,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:5e",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"Knowing your true self{n} is quite a hard thing.\"",
  "src": "6aac41fe933a"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0070",
  "off": 4610,
  "end": 4622,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:5e",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"......\"",
  "src": "3f2971df0f91"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0071",
  "off": 4624,
  "end": 4648,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:5e",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"Well then, until we meet again.\"",
  "src": "4a0540a37a72"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0072",
  "off": 4654,
  "end": 4710,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"Hey!? Kill me!{n} Kill me before you go! Hey!?\"",
  "src": "9f57d96de393"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0073",
  "off": 4716,
  "end": 4752,
  "block": 14,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:5e",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"I told you I can't do that, didn't I?\"",
  "src": "2a10d531aabd"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0074",
  "off": 4766,
  "end": 4864,
  "block": 15,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"Hey! Wait! Hey!{n} I know! You're scared!{n} You're just scared of killing people!\"",
  "src": "24e5818e7b27"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0075",
  "off": 4866,
  "end": 4970,
  "block": 15,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"And yet you pile on this reason and{n} that, just making excuses to yourself!{n} In the end you're nothing but a weakling!\"",
  "src": "edb82f2f9ad0"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0076",
  "off": 4972,
  "end": 5070,
  "block": 15,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"I'll never end up like that!{n} When I kill, I'll kill without wavering!{n} And at the very end, I'll win!\"",
  "src": "df055203091e"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0077",
  "off": 5072,
  "end": 5146,
  "block": 15,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"I'll get my revenge on the ones{n} who laughed at me!{n} Someday! Some day, I will!\"",
  "src": "1fd8057c5caa"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0078",
  "off": 5148,
  "end": 5178,
  "block": 16,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"The man walked away, just like that.\"",
  "src": "0d4469a20496"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0079",
  "off": 5180,
  "end": 5268,
  "block": 16,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"When I got home... maybe he'd despaired{n} of everything, or maybe he no longer{n} knew what was what...\"",
  "src": "9e166ff29854"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0080",
  "off": 5270,
  "end": 5304,
  "block": 16,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"My old man had hanged himself.\"",
  "src": "d114d9f7c411"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0081",
  "off": 5306,
  "end": 5414,
  "block": 16,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"That's when I made up my mind anew:{n} I'll live, and live, and survive to the end.{n} And I'll take victory, no matter what.\"",
  "src": "00a728983d2a"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0082",
  "off": 5416,
  "end": 5428,
  "block": 16,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"But...\"",
  "src": "c83367f65de4"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0083",
  "off": 5430,
  "end": 5532,
  "block": 16,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"What is victory, anyway? Just as that{n} question came to me in the dream,{n} I slowly woke up.\"",
  "src": "4de6e9643ffa"
 },
 {
  "id": "K103_0084",
  "off": 5534,
  "end": 5596,
  "block": 16,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8002:1",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"The first thing I saw was a pitch-black{n} night sky with no moon and no stars.\"",
  "src": "022356b88c53"
 }
]